.TH DIR 1
.SH NAME
dir \- directory/file browser window
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wm/dir
.RI [ directory ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Dir
is the Wm desktop's own directory browser: a window listing the
entries of
.I directory
(the current directory if none given), with an
.B Options
menu and a title bar showing the path being viewed. Double-clicking a
subdirectory opens it in the same style; double-clicking a file or
.B !Run
script inside an app folder launches it.
.PP
This is the window the pinboard opens for
.B !
app folders (such as
.BR Apps/!DreamMachines ),
and can equally be launched directly on any path.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/wm/dir.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR pinboard (1)
